WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.879
Film Courage: [What are] your thoughts on work-life balance? Dr. Ken Atchity, Author/Producer: Well
if you don't see a difference between

00:00:05.879 --> 00:00:11.639
work and life it's hard to figure out
how to answer that question but I guess

00:00:11.639 --> 00:00:18.770
my basic view of it is that work is what
you get to do when you're not living and

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:24.990
so therefore whenever life interrupts
work it makes me happy because you know

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:30.810
grandkids are coming this weekend and
what could be better but you know if it

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:37.380
weren't for work life would just kind of
swallow you up and spit you out at the

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:45.090
end of the day so work is what I do when
I you know when I get to and the balance

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:50.940
is simply to let life do what it has to
do like the other day of one of my

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.860
friend's father died and although I
didn't know him I I just decided I had

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:59.789
to go to the to the funeral
even though it was the day where I had

00:00:59.789 --> 00:01:03.840
you know a couple of pitches at the
studios and so on but I just drove out

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:08.520
to to the food to the funeral because
that's okay and I didn't think about

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:16.439
work all day and and I didn't complain
there is I usually do that I didn't get

00:01:16.439 --> 00:01:20.790
any work done that day because once in a
while you do have to pay your your

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:25.920
regards to life and recognize that it's
there but when I think about how many

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:32.729
people who say they want to work and do
work and don't do it and I go what are

00:01:32.729 --> 00:01:37.290
you doing they go well life just keeps
happening and I don't quite understand

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:42.899
that because that person says the same
amount of time that I do and that we all

00:01:42.899 --> 00:01:48.210
do and it's matter of choice at a
certain point I mean you can I mean we

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:55.079
travel we love to eat out we love to do
home things we love to cook we love to

00:01:55.079 --> 00:01:59.820
do all the things that people a lot of
people like to do but we both you know

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:07.380
my wife and I both work very hard
